# Libraries provided by Windows itself. These must never be bundled: shipping a
# copy of a system DLL either does nothing or actively breaks on a Windows
# version whose other components expect the matching original.
#
# Entries are path patterns matched case-insensitively against the resolved
# path, or against "<unresolved>/<name>" when a dependency could not be
# resolved. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# The dependency walker prunes at these without resolving them, which also keeps
# the traversal out of the operating system: unpruned, it reaches several hundred
# system DLLs and surfaces unresolvable references from deep inside them that
# could never be satisfied.
#
# NOTE: the includelist takes precedence over this file. A handful of
# redistributables that live in System32 (the MSVC runtime, dbghelp) are
# deliberately bundled and are listed there.
